Hey,
I have found the answer, I think it is like tar..

You must pax the file(s) according to current directory so that it can
be extracted to the current directory...

i.e, to pax root directory

cd /

pax -w -f /dev/tape/tape0c .

to read the file
 
pax -r -f /dev/tape/tape0c ./fileNameHERE


