> > > > einstein.agnld.uni-potsdam.de
> > >
> > > Similar to the problem I solved just yesterday, it seems.  You do not
> > > seem to have auditd running and it may not even be configured.  If you
> > > read audgen(8) you will be pointed to audit_setup(8).  After running
> > > audit_setup (you can accept just about all defaults) you need to edit
> > > /etc/sec/auditd_clients and add the FQDN's of the hosts connecting to
> > > your server, particularly einstein.agnld.uni-potsdam.de  and make sure
> > > that the user joerg has an account on that server.
> >
> > Thank you for your tips.
> > But ssh3.4 will not works for normal users. :-(
