This is quite common when doing X development.
A better place to ask may be comp.windows.x ...

If you have source to the app, add 

  XSynchronize(display, 1);

immediately after opening Display, then set breakpoint
on _XError, continue to breakpoint and examine stack to see what
request triggered the error.

