Setld �i	Displays a list of installed subsets
Netconfig	Manage network configuration processes
Boot /gen/vmunix	Standard kernel
Touch /etc/nologin	Prevent all users except root from logging in when
this file exists
Bcheckrc	Checks and mounts all
Disklabel �r #	Make changes to disk labels. With �r, reads and outputs
the label directly from disk.
Diskconfig	Brings up disk config manager
/sbin/sysconfig �s	Queries and lists state of all subsystems
Sizer	Displays info about system, creates a sys configuration file 
Kopt	Kernel options
/etc/vdumpdates	Timestamp entry from start of backup
dupatch 	Install a patch
Dupatch �track �type patch	Lists all patches installed on system
Top	Shows top 10 processes
/usr/bin/X11./dtadvfs	Opens Advanced File System Manager
Sys_check	Outputs system information into and html file.

Also useful is the following website.  You can choose your flavors and
